 "sentences": [
  "London’s Battersea Bridge was once dangerously wooden.",
  "It replaced a ferry service operating since the 1500s.",
  "John, Earl Spencer, originally planned a stone bridge.",
  "Investment difficulties meant he built with wood instead.",
  "The bridge was poorly designed and often hit by passing boats.",
  "Two piers were eventually removed to fix the danger.",
  "Famous artists like Whistler later painted this unpopular structure."
